ring Carthage. Why are you withdrawing your application? What factors have led you to prefer other college options? If you have made a final college choice, what college will you be attending? School CEEB (hidden) School Level of Study (Hidden: Default = Undergraduate) Undergraduate School Competitor Flag (Hidden: Default = Yes) Yes If you haven't made a final college choice, what other colleges are you considering? The most important factors in my decision are: Questions I would like answered include: Amount Due Loading... Default Slate ID: 149688290 (Enrollment Deposit Twenty Twenty-Six) NOTE: The $200 enrollment deposit is non-refundable. Search for student: Submit 2001 Alford Park Drive Kenosha, WI 53140 (800) 351-4058 Contact Map & Directions Request Info Apply Visit Alumni Arts Athletics Academics The Bridge Virtual Tour Visit Carthage Instagram Twitter Facebook YouTube LinkedIn Flickr Merit Pages ©Carthage College Privacy Policy Non-Discrimination Statement Policies Title IX"
